      "title": "sshdig: Add Option for \"modern-bpf\"",
      "message": "sshdig: Add Option for \"modern-bpf\"\n\n`sysdig` has an option called \"--modern-bpf\". With this option eBPF is\nused and there is no need for a kernel module. This makes it much easier\nto run captures.\n",
      "author_name": "Uli Heilmeier",
